<title>USA: ESC Medical files to market laser system.</title>
<headline>ESC Medical files to market laser system.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel-based ESC Medical Systems Ltd said on Thursday that it has filed a 510k application with the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for clearance to market the Topaz 30 surgical CO2 laser system in the United States.</p>
<p>The Topaz 30 is a CO2 laser system used for general surgical and dermatological applications, ESC said.</p>
<p>Over 50 systems were sold and placed outside the United States, ESC said.</p>
